# Build outputs
/dist/
target/
java/**/target/
java/**/dependency-reduced-pom.xml
**/*.rs.bk

# Local caches. Everything must stay *inside* this directory (mission rule),
# but none of it belongs in git.
/.cargo-home/
/.m2-repo/
/.deps/
/.rustup/
/.cache/

# Agent/tool session droppings — same category as .idea/, just louder
/.zcode/

# Secrets and generated test PKI. Test certs are generated per-run in the
# container and must never be committed. Yes, we trust ourselves less than
# the §6 BDSG compliance checklist. That is the point.
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.csr
.env
.env.*

# Exception: the interop fixtures are Governikus' PUBLIC demo keystores
# (PIN "123456", published in osci-bib-java at tag 2.6.1, see
# docs/TEST-INFRASTRUCTURE.md). They are not ours, not secret, and the
# test intermediary rejects anything it did not issue itself anyway
# (feedback code 3707). Pinned by SHA256SUMS next to them.
!crates/osci-cli/tests/fixtures/interop/*.p12
!crates/osci-cli/tests/fixtures/interop/*.pem

# IDE and OS droppings — the bureaucracy of tooling, if you will
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store

# coverage artifacts
/coverage/

# libFuzzer corpora and artifacts
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
fuzz/target/
fuzz/coverage/
